{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2024-biology-17","exam":"MDEET","year":2024,"subject":"biology","number":17,"points":5,"unitId":"enzyme","unitLabel":"효소","classificationStatus":"editorial-content-based","stem":"다음은\n피리미딘\n생합성에\n관여하는\nATCase (aspartate\ntranscarbamoylase)에 대한 자료이다.\n◦ATCase 촉매 반응\n◦N-카바모일아스파트산은 최종 산물인 CTP로 변환되어\nATCase의 활성을 억제한다.\n◦그림의 (가)는 기질 농도에 따른 ATCase의 반응 속도 곡선을\n나타낸 것이며, ㉠과 ㉡은 (가)의 조건에 각각 ATP 또는\nCTP 중 하나를 첨가하여 얻은 반응 속도 곡선이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n[5점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. ATCase는 연결효소(ligase)이다.\nㄴ. ATP를 첨가하여 얻은 곡선은 ㉠이다.\nㄷ. ATCase는 다른자리입체성 효소(allosteric enzyme)이다.","options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t023"]}],"answer":5,"assets":[{"id":"fig-01","src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2024-biology-17/01.webp","width":931,"height":990,"region":0,"bbox":[15.33,52.7,310.33,330.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"]},{"id":"fig-02","src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2024-biology-17/02.webp","width":930,"height":229,"region":0,"bbox":[15.33,453.7,310.0,76.33],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t016","t017","t018"]}],"layout":[{"page":9,"sourceRect":[82.0,147.3,413.0,706.44],"width":331.0,"height":559.15,"items":[{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"17. 다음은","bbox":[5.9,10.0,57.28,12.28],"spans":[{"text":"17.","bbox":[5.9,10.0,16.36,12.28],"origin":[5.9,19.02],"size":11.7,"flags":4,"font":"*ÇÑ¾ç°ß¸íÁ¶"},{"text":" 다음은 ","bbox":[22.26,10.75,40.92,11.37],"origin":[22.26,19.02],"size":10.72,"flags":4,"font":"*½Å¸í-Áß¸íÁ¶"}],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t002","type":"text","text":"피리미딘","bbox":[73.58,10.87,43.84,11.25],"spans":[{"text":"피리미딘 ","bbox":[73.58,10.87,43.84,11.25],"origin":[73.58,19.14],"size":10.72,"flags":4,"font":"*½Å¸í-Áß¸íÁ¶"}],"section":"